<?xml version="1.0" standalone="yes"?>

<!DOCTYPE PLUGIN [
<!ENTITY name "smb-bulk-share">
<!ENTITY author "Ray Munro">
<!ENTITY version "2026.09.14d">
<!ENTITY package "&name;-&version;-noarch-1.txz">
<!ENTITY github "RayMunro/unraid-smb-bulk-share">
<!ENTITY pluginURL "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/&github;/main/&name;.plg">
]>

<PLUGIN name="&name;" author="&author;" version="&version;" launch="Settings/&name;" min="6.12.0" icon="smb-bulk-share.png"
        pluginURL="&pluginURL;"
        support="https://github.com/&github;/issues"
        project="https://github.com/&github;"
        readme="https://github.com/&github;#readme">

<CHANGES>
<![CDATA[
### 2026.09.14d
- Add a copyright notice to the Settings page, matching the other HackerHog plugins.

### 2026.09.14c
- Add Icon/Type=xmenu to the page header so Settings -> User Utilities shows a real icon tile instead of the generic page icon.

### 2026.09.14b
- Register the plugin icon as a native PNG (Unraid's Plugin Manager icon only supports raster images, not the SVG added in 2026.09.14).

### 2026.09.14
- Add a plugin icon, shown on the Settings page and in Community Applications.
- Add a reproducible build.sh, matching the rest of the HackerHog plugins.

### 2026.09.02a
- Replace the unavailable PHP `is_socket()` call with the portable
  `file_exists()` check used for Unraid's management socket.

### 2026.09.02
- Initial release.
- Enable or disable SMB export across included user shares.
- Preserve Public, Secure and Private security modes.
- Preserve existing hidden and Time Machine modes when enabling.
- Configurable exclusions with safe defaults.
- Optional five-minute automatic enforcement.
- Timestamped backups and one-click restoration.
]]>
</CHANGES>

